	(text_box "Note: 	The stackup connectors are for connections \n		between the power and comms boards. The power \n		board is female and the comms board is male, \n		allowing them to plug into each other for the \n		interboard connections.\n\n		The debug connector is a right angle connector \n		which allows for connections to be made to each \n		subsystem in order to use an oscilloscope to \n		measure the signals."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
